# Course Evaluations

=== layout: one-panel

# Course Evaluations

@body

- Hi Students,
- You will be receiving an email to complete [course evaluations]{color=#D40000} for your courses.
- I want to encourage you to complete them, they are our [primary source for evaluating faculty performance]{color=#D40000}.
- Your opinion does matter; it can help determine who gets salary raises, and a string of negative evaluations can get a professor replaced.
- Further, I appreciate getting [your feedback]{color=#D40000} in an anonymous way. It helps me [improve the courses]{color=#D40000} I teach.
- Thanks, Dr. Voss

=== layout: one-panel

# Course Evaluations

@body

- When the IDEA Student Ratings of Instruction survey opens, complete it by the published deadline.
- It can take up to 5-10 minutes to complete the Course Evaluation
- Once the survey opens, sign in at:
  - [https\://roosevelt.campuslabs.com/eval-home/](https://roosevelt.campuslabs.com/eval-home/)
  - Students may log in with their RU Net ID and password.
